[TITLE]
STEADY routing with quality and water age -- the corpus's first STEADY deck.
The quality link update has an explicit is_steady branch (c_new = c_up,
bypassing the volume-balance mixing) in the pollutant path AND in each CSTR
mirror (age, heat, R4b's MSX), and until this deck nothing observed any of
them. Composition follows README.md: reach a path no other deck does.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         STEADY
WATER_AGE            YES
START_DATE           06/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             06/01/2026
END_TIME             06:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         30
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00

[JUNCTIONS]
J0  10.0  4.0  0  0  0
J1   9.0  4.0  0  0  0
J2   8.0  4.0  0  0  0

[OUTFALLS]
OUT  6.5  FREE  NO

[CONDUITS]
C1  J0  J1   400  0.013  0  0  0
C2  J1  J2   400  0.013  0  0  0
C3  J2  OUT  400  0.013  0  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
C1  CIRCULAR  1.5  0  0  0
C2  CIRCULAR  1.5  0  0  0
C3  CIRCULAR  1.5  0  0  0

[POLLUTANTS]
TSS  MG/L  0  0  0  0.10

[INFLOWS]
J0  FLOW  ""     FLOW    1.0  1.0  2.0
J0  TSS   T_TSS  CONCEN  1.0  1.0

[TIMESERIES]
T_TSS  0:00  50.0
T_TSS  3:00  10.0
T_TSS  6:00  10.0

[REPORT]
INPUT      NO
CONTINUITY YES
NODES      ALL
LINKS      ALL
